{"sections":[{"slug":"index","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"index"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯百科</span> Simplopedia"},"taxon":{"Plain":"Meta. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"单纯百科 Simplopedia"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"Meta"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这里是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯百科","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯百科</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的主目录</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">欢迎访问</span><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://simplicialcat.github.io/index.html?lang=zh\" title=\"我的个人主页 [https://simplicialcat.github.io/index.html?lang=zh]\"><span lang=\"zh\">我的个人主页</span></a></span>.</p>\n<p>You may also want to visit <span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://simplicialcat.github.io/index.html?lang=en\" title=\"my personal main page [https://simplicialcat.github.io/index.html?lang=en]\">my personal main page</a></span> (in English).</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">分类</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">单纯百科的页面分为以下几类</span>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>“<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>” (<code>wiki</code>) : <span lang=\"zh\">数学概念</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这类页面构成了单纯百科的主体</span>.</li>\n<li>“"},{"Local":{"url":"/notion","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">观念</span>"}},{"Plain":"” (<code>notion</code>) : <span lang=\"zh\">模糊而普遍的数学思想</span>.</li>\n<li>“"},{"Local":{"url":"/pedagogy","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">教学</span>"}},{"Plain":"” (<code>pedagogy</code>) : <span lang=\"zh\">面向基础读者的科普</span>.</li>\n<li>“"},{"Local":{"url":"/notes","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">讲稿</span>"}},{"Plain":"” (<code>notes</code>) : <span lang=\"zh\">一些讨论班的讲稿</span>.</li>\n<li>“<span lang=\"zh\">文献</span>” (<code>reference</code>) : <span lang=\"zh\">其它页面中引用到的参考文献</span>.</li>\n<li>“"},{"Local":{"url":"/subject","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">学科</span>"}},{"Plain":"” (<code>subject</code>) : <span lang=\"zh\">用于收集和分类</span>.</li>\n<li>“<span lang=\"zh\">元</span>” (<code>meta</code>) : <span lang=\"zh\">关于单纯百科本身</span>.</li>\n<li>“"},{"Local":{"url":"/nonmath","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">非数学</span>"}},{"Plain":"” (<code>nonmath</code>) : <span lang=\"zh\">一些不属于上述分类</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且不属于数学的东西</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">点击</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">可以看到本站的所有页面</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">欢迎所有读者</span><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"mailto:wangjiny24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn\" title=\"通过邮箱联系我 [mailto:wangjiny24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn]\"><span lang=\"zh\">通过邮箱联系我</span></a></span> <code>wangjiny24@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn</code> , <span lang=\"zh\">交流</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">催更</span>. (<span lang=\"zh\">对于好友</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">通过微信或</span> QQ <span lang=\"zh\">联系我当然是更加欢迎的</span>.)</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/todo","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">亟需施工处</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">列表</span> (“TODO list”)</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/terminologies","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">术语翻译表</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">最近</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/OpAlgMod","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">算畴上的代数上的模</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/多项式函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">多项式函子</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/LCCC","text":"LCCC"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/单子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/Kleisli范畴","text":"Kleisli <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", "},{"Local":{"url":"/对称序列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称序列</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">精选</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶Morita范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶</span> Morita <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita等价","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">等价</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/充实范畴上的模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">充实范畴上的模</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断性</span